  "known_local_policies": [
    "Learn Draconic uses existing committed physical spell-Mana rows and explicit spell-source consumption records; health substitution, minions, hero powers, trade and forge do not count. Unique original debit units advance at most the eight-point goal.",
    "Elemental Allies uses completed original submitted Elemental plays, one progress per genuine own-turn interval; an owner turn ending without a credited Elemental resets it. No earlier play before activation receives retroactive credit.",
    "Sky Temple and Waygate reuse the ordinary spell_cast_started attempt policy: normal casts and countered hand attempts count, other failed automatic attempts do not; each original cast ID counts once.",
    "Waygate requires actual opening physical deck identity; an unknown Scenario never guesses from card names. Physical copies outside the original deck and replaced original faces qualify under the existing local provenance policy.",
    "The existing complete Time Warp body and its per-player once-per-game effect are reused unchanged. Original quest hand rewards use the existing deferred-capacity wrapper; no ordinary hand-generation policy changes.",
